# Local run artifacts — snapshots, caches, verdicts, windows, exports (never commit)
*_snapshot*.json
prune_snapshot_*.json
portal_*.json
portals_*.json
tnc_*.json
# Genie-V3 agent memory — these are KNOWLEDGE, not run artifacts, and must stay
# tracked. `tnc_*.json` above (a run-artifact rule) would otherwise swallow
# tnc_memory.json while its two siblings stayed tracked, which is the kind of
# silent asymmetry that bites much later.
!tnc_memory.json
!domain_history.json
!infrastructure_block.json
*_done.json
*_noportal.json
*_cache.json
*_verdicts.json
*_rows.json
jsvalidate_verdicts.json
traffic_table.json
traffic_table.html
reviewed_orgs_traffic.png
*.flag

# ---- Genie-V3 generated output ----
# Every per-run artefact (date-stamped CSVs and logs) is written under output/,
# so ONE directory mask covers all of it. The broad *.csv and *.log rules above
# are deliberately KEPT rather than replaced: 51 CSV data files leaked into this
# repo's history once already, and those masks are what stop a stray export
# anywhere else in the tree from repeating it.
output/

# ---- Run artifacts from the disabled-orgs / reported-url workflows ----
# Sharded worker state, per-run verdicts, colour maps, before/after snapshots.
# All regenerable; several embed org data. Never commit.
